# Files that cc-doctrine should inject at SessionStart and after compaction.
# Add one path per line. Relative paths resolve from this repository; absolute
# paths are supported but make the configuration machine-specific.
#
# Keep this list short because every entry consumes context on every injection.
# Prefer the main Claude/Codex instruction files for ordinary workflow rules and
# use this list only when a separate document genuinely must always be loaded.
#
# Example:
# docs/team-conventions.md
